WEBVTT

00:00:07.548 --> 00:00:09.049
Tinkles, sit!

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:19.101
Whose idea was it
to let Dennis have a puppy?

00:00:20.435 --> 00:00:21.436
Yours?

00:00:23.198 --> 00:00:24.271
Right.

00:00:25.315 --> 00:00:26.900
Poor Tinkles.

00:00:27.067 --> 00:00:28.235
Dennis...

00:00:29.153 --> 00:00:31.613
Look, honey, I know you love Tinkles,

00:00:31.697 --> 00:00:33.866
but we're not allowed
to bring our dogs...

00:00:34.413 --> 00:00:36.702
I mean, our pets everywhere.

00:00:36.785 --> 00:00:37.870
Okay?

00:00:38.245 --> 00:00:39.288
Okay.

00:00:43.125 --> 00:00:45.586
DJ Jazzy Johnny in the house.

00:00:45.669 --> 00:00:50.048
It's time to welcome the happy couple,
Mr. and Mrs. Prickles!

00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:58.557
The bride and groom invite everyone
to join them on the dance floor.

00:01:02.811 --> 00:01:04.062
Care to dance?

00:01:09.026 --> 00:01:11.737
-Is that her?
-Watch out now.

00:01:11.904 --> 00:01:14.406
She got stitches
in all the right places.

00:01:14.573 --> 00:01:17.659
Okay, there's no way that
is related to you, Frank.

00:01:17.913 --> 00:01:19.369
No, she's my right arm's cousin.

00:01:23.957 --> 00:01:25.167
I see it now.

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:27.252
Frank wanted me to meet you.

00:01:27.336 --> 00:01:30.839
We're arm cousins, twice removed.

00:01:32.549 --> 00:01:33.592
Of course.

00:01:34.301 --> 00:01:37.304
I'd recognize that bicep anywhere.

00:01:37.554 --> 00:01:41.475
He thought, since we're both single,
we might hit it off, maybe go on a date?

00:01:41.488 --> 00:01:42.514
"Date"?

00:01:43.101 --> 00:01:45.520
Well, it's just that...

00:01:49.983 --> 00:01:52.236
The DJ booth is a sacred space!

00:01:53.654 --> 00:01:54.965
I love this song!

00:01:57.407 --> 00:01:58.450
Don't you?

00:01:58.617 --> 00:01:59.743
Dracula?

00:02:00.369 --> 00:02:01.536
Where'd he go?

00:02:01.787 --> 00:02:03.622
Dracula?

00:02:07.084 --> 00:02:08.877
What's the matter, Drac,
you didn't like her?

00:02:08.961 --> 00:02:11.171
No offense, but you can't be too picky.

00:02:11.255 --> 00:02:13.215
You haven't had a date in 100 years.

00:02:13.298 --> 00:02:17.552
Look, guys, I appreciate your concern,
but it's not up to me.

00:02:17.761 --> 00:02:20.430
You only Zing once, and I did.

00:02:21.139 --> 00:02:22.391
Times have changed, buddy.

00:02:22.474 --> 00:02:25.477
You can even find someone
to Zing with on your phone now.

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:27.229
What? Really?

00:02:27.312 --> 00:02:28.772
No, no, no.

00:02:28.855 --> 00:02:30.107
I'm far too busy.

00:02:30.190 --> 00:02:34.236
I have Mavis and Dennis and the hotel,
and bleh, bleh-bleh.

00:02:35.904 --> 00:02:36.947
Did you guys hear that?

00:02:37.030 --> 00:02:39.119
He actually said, "Bleh, bleh-bleh."

00:02:39.122 --> 00:02:41.118
I don't say, "Bleh, bleh-bleh"!

00:02:49.835 --> 00:02:52.254
I'm looking for a Zing.

00:02:52.629 --> 00:02:54.673
Okay. Changing phone ring.

00:02:55.424 --> 00:02:58.251
No. no. I'm looking for a date.

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:02.723
No, no, no.

00:03:02.806 --> 00:03:04.683
I want to meet someone.

00:03:07.853 --> 00:03:09.771
Are you kidding me right now?

00:03:09.855 --> 00:03:13.066
Don't you get it?
I want to go on a date!

00:03:13.150 --> 00:03:15.485
I'm lonely.

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:19.516
You want baloney.

00:03:25.787 --> 00:03:27.385
What? Look at that hair. Come on.

00:03:28.373 --> 00:03:29.406
Too many eyes.

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:30.797
Too few eyes.

00:03:31.171 --> 00:03:32.502
Not into tentacles.

00:03:32.878 --> 00:03:34.004
"Match found"?

00:03:34.504 --> 00:03:35.881
No, no, no!

00:03:35.964 --> 00:03:37.174
First things first.

00:03:38.467 --> 00:03:39.551
I'm not into games.

00:03:39.634 --> 00:03:42.262
You'd better have a job,
and my cats have to like you.

00:03:44.931 --> 00:03:45.932
No.

00:03:46.016 --> 00:03:47.017
No.

00:03:47.996 --> 00:03:49.017
Dad?

00:03:49.309 --> 00:03:50.320
Mavis!

00:03:50.937 --> 00:03:52.189
What are you doing here?

00:03:52.272 --> 00:03:54.983
I was just checking on the honeymoon
suite, and I heard something.

00:03:55.609 --> 00:03:57.235
I'm sorry, my little bedbug.

00:03:57.319 --> 00:03:59.446
I was just cleaning the attic.

00:04:04.951 --> 00:04:07.079
It's so dirty, yes...

00:04:07.162 --> 00:04:09.081
-Who is that?
-Are you on the phone?

00:04:09.644 --> 00:04:14.169
What, this?
I was just trying to find a maid

00:04:14.252 --> 00:04:16.630
-to help me with the mess.
-A maid?

00:04:16.713 --> 00:04:18.924
-Who do you think...
-Thank you, I'll check your references

00:04:19.007 --> 00:04:20.384
and get back to you. Goodbye!

00:04:24.821 --> 00:04:25.834
Dad.

00:04:26.098 --> 00:04:27.766
Stop trying to hide it from me.

00:04:27.849 --> 00:04:30.185
Hide? Who? I mean, what? Me?

00:04:30.268 --> 00:04:31.353
Yes.

00:04:31.436 --> 00:04:33.146
And I know what it is.

00:04:34.189 --> 00:04:35.190
Really?

00:04:35.273 --> 00:04:37.479
You're stressed out
from working too hard.

00:04:39.319 --> 00:04:40.529
Okay, yes.

00:04:40.612 --> 00:04:41.947
You got me.

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:44.116
It's a big hotel, you know?

00:04:44.199 --> 00:04:45.700
Can't get to everything.

00:04:45.867 --> 00:04:46.952
But what about you?

00:04:47.035 --> 00:04:48.912
You're pretty busy yourself.

00:04:48.995 --> 00:04:52.332
I know. It seems like now that
we're working together more,

00:04:52.416 --> 00:04:53.875
we're seeing each other less.

00:04:55.335 --> 00:04:57.170
Yeah. You're absolutely right.

00:04:57.254 --> 00:05:00.090
I am working too much,
you're working too much.

00:05:00.173 --> 00:05:03.260
We should really take a break,
starting right now.

00:05:03.343 --> 00:05:04.511
Night-night.

00:05:09.361 --> 00:05:10.684
I'm still here!

00:05:27.117 --> 00:05:28.160
Hey, honey.

00:05:28.326 --> 00:05:29.619
You ready for

00:05:30.454 --> 00:05:32.080
date night?

00:05:33.498 --> 00:05:34.666
That's okay, sweetheart.

00:05:34.749 --> 00:05:36.001
You rest.

00:05:39.754 --> 00:05:41.214
You know, Dad's right.

00:05:41.408 --> 00:05:42.436
We need a break.

00:05:42.799 --> 00:05:45.635
We need to all be together again,
like a family.

00:05:46.011 --> 00:05:47.345
Like we used to.

00:05:50.390 --> 00:05:52.976
Are you overworked and stressed out?

00:05:53.059 --> 00:05:55.228
Do you need some family time?

00:05:55.312 --> 00:05:57.355
Are you a monster?

00:05:57.439 --> 00:05:59.733
Then you need a vacation,

00:05:59.816 --> 00:06:01.902
a monster vacation.

00:06:01.985 --> 00:06:04.988
Sail away, sail away, sail away

00:06:06.615 --> 00:06:09.451
Welcome aboard Gremlin Air.

